d 'DAGUMFIT': module to fit a Dagum distribution by maximum likelihood
d
d     dagumfit fits by ML the 3 parameter Dagum  distribution to
d sample observations	 on a random variable.	dagumpred
d calculates statistics summarizing a Dagum distribution which	 
d has been fitted using dagumfit. Unit record data are assumed
d (rather than grouped data). 
d
d KW: Dagum distribution
d KW: inequality
d KW: maximum likelihood
d
d Requires: Stata version 11
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260909
d
d Author: Stephen P. Jenkins, University of Essex
d Support: email stephenj@@essex.ac.uk
d
f dagumfit.ado
f dagumfit_ll.ado
f dagumfit.sthlp
f dagumpred.ado
f dagumpred.sthlp
